tyle=\"font-weight: 600; color: #475569;\">P3L Developers, Nairobi</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top: 3px; font-size: 10px; color: #94a3b8;\">This email was automated by P3L Helpdesk Delivery System. Please do not reply.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
  },
